{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7665550295406217526","title":"马达工程师-2027校招","description":"1、在导师指导下参与马达 RFI 的整理与定制选商工作,学习从产品需求到马达规格的拆解方法;\n2、协助开展马达在整机系统上的应用验证,参与各项性能参数的测试、匹配与优化分析;\n3、参与马达设计开发各阶段评审,协助跟进重点风险项的改善、验证与闭环记录;\n4、跟踪马达行业动态与新兴驱动技术,做技术调研与内部分享;\n5、协助维护马达 checklist、roadmap 等技术文档。\n\n","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历,机械、机电、自动化、精密仪器、电磁场等相关专业;\n2、具备扎实的机械结构设计与力学基础,了解电磁场、驱动与控制的基本原理,对可靠性/仿真有基本认识;\n3、了解常见马达驱动形式(音圈 VCM、piezo、弹片、滚珠、导杆、SMA 等)中的一种或几种者优先;\n4、有相机模组、精密驱动、OIS/潜望/光变等相关课题、竞赛、实习或项目经历者优先;\n5、掌握至少一种三维设计软件,用过 Maxwell/Ansys 等仿真工具者优先;\n6. 学习能力强、逻辑清晰、认真严谨、抗压能力好,乐于沟通与分享,有主动钻研和坚持把事做对的意愿。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784775234711,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7665550295406053686","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}